WEBVTT

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:03.226
some say reptilian,
response to our environment.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:08.559
How can we disengage or unhook ourselves
from the horns of the amygdala?

00:06:08.583 --> 00:06:10.684
(Laughter)

00:06:10.708 --> 00:06:13.643
Well, I'd like to tell you
the secret right now.

00:06:13.667 --> 00:06:16.875
(Applause)

00:06:21.583 --> 00:06:24.059
This is all making
much, much too much sense.

00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:26.333
(Laughter)

00:06:28.167 --> 00:06:31.351
The secret lies